# Fireshrieker: "Equipped creature has double strike", Equip {2}. When the equipped creature dies the Equipment stays on the
# battlefield, attached to nothing (CR 704.5n), and can be equipped again. Bot1 equips Memnite on turn 3; Bot2's
# Lightning Bolt kills it on turn 4. On turn 5 two Moxen move Fireshrieker onto the Ornithopter, which then has double strike.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Memnite
Fireshrieker
Ornithopter
Mountain x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Island x18

